## Communication and bilingual report update

- [x] Correct office schedule to Monday-Friday, 09:00-18:00.
- [x] Implement next-opening-plus-one-hour deadlines and boundary/DST tests.
- [x] Add private WhatsApp/IMAP intake and SMTP/Meta outbox adapters.
- [x] Separate automated acknowledgments, re-engagement and human replies.
- [x] Add the communications migration and isolated CI database checks.
- [x] Generate equivalent English and European Portuguese dissertations.
- [ ] Configure provider accounts, credentials and private HTTPS hosting.
- [ ] Activate supervised collectors/workers and staff queue coverage.
- [ ] Validate actual delivery and end-to-end provider behavior with test recipients.

The items above describe the September communication update; actual test and
publication evidence is recorded in docs/RELEASE_VALIDATION.md.
